>>> Optimal	Construction, Thermal/Riot Armor 
>> Suitable	Firefighter's gear
X Inadvisable 	Tools, Weapons, Durability
			
Tools Recommended: None			
Notes: Apparel made from this is equipped much faster

Aerographene, or graphene aerogel is the only known solid that is lighter than air. It has incredible compression strength and insulation properties making it ideal for thermal-rated armor, riot gear, and even fire protection. It is encapsulated in a polymer matrix to increase toughness at the cost of extra weight.</description>
